      "updated_at": "2017-03-03T21:13:20Z",
      "body": "Oh I think it's the Prebake adblock filter which hides all EU cookie notices.\r\n\r\nThis shows the danger of calling the section \"cookies\" and making it a prime target of various browser addons...\r\n\r\nI guess renaming it is out of the question since the docs are autogenerated?",
