      "created_at": "2017-03-04T08:53:57Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-03-04T08:54:24Z",
      "body": "> This shows the danger of calling the section \"cookies\" and making it a prime target of various browser addons...\r\n\r\nMhhm, let me imagine the issues which will be open if the section was named \"Kekse\", \"Småkage\" or \"biscuits\". `Cookie` is a well-known name for the concept it describes. \r\n\r\nBut because it interests me: Which name would you suggest?\r\n",
