      "body": "@mtdowling Oh so it's a 3rd party doc generator...\r\n\r\nEhh, then I don't know what to do. They're unlikely to change markup just because your project has a \"cookies\" id/heading.\r\n\r\nPerhaps add a notice about disabling adblocker while reading the docs to ensure the cookies section isn't hidden?\r\n\r\nIt would have to be a small info box at the top of the \"Request Options\" page to be seen.\r\n\r\nThe \"cookies\" link under Request Options goes nowhere since that whole section is killed by the adblocker, so it can't be put there... :\\",
