      "updated_at": "2018-05-10T23:17:30Z",
      "body": "As a \"least worst solution\", how about adding a html comment?\r\n\r\nProbably, a fraction of people encountering the issue would have a look at the html source, thus it would help reducing the amount of reports.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx/issues/2719 for the method to implement this.",
